    <string name="privacy_body">Asilamu amalemekeza zinsinsi zanu ndipo samasonkhanitsa deta yanu.\n\n• Palibe kutsatira: palibe ma SDK otsatsa, ma analytics kapena otsatsa malonda.\n• Deta imakhala pachida chanu: data yanu yonse (malo, zoikamo, zosungira) zimasungidwa kwanuko pa chipangizo chanu chokha.\n• Malo amagwiritsidwa ntchito kwanuko: zolumikizira zanu zimagwiritsidwa ntchito kuwerengera nthawi yapemphero ndi qibla pa chipangizo chanu, ndipo sizitumizidwa ku seva yakunja.\n• Zilolezo zikafunika: timapempha zilolezo (malo, zidziwitso) pokhapokha ngati chinthu chikuzifuna, ndi kulongosola bwino.\n• Palibe kulumikizidwa mokakamizidwa: pulogalamuyi imagwira ntchito popanda intaneti; kugwiritsa ntchito ma netiweki ndizosankha pazowonjezera monga kutsitsa zowerengera.\n\nNdondomekoyi ndi gawo la nkhokwe zotseguka ndipo ndi lotseguka kuti anthu aziwunikenso.</string>
